# RFM_Customer_Segmentation_Dashboard..pbix# RFM Customer Segmentation & Sales Analytics Dashboard

An interactive Power BI dashboard built for customer segmentation using **Recency, Frequency, and Monetary (RFM)** analysis alongside transaction sales and regional location insights.

## Project Details
- **Author:** Maliha Siddiqui
- **Program:** Progree Data Analytics Internship
- **Tools Used:** Power BI Desktop, Python (Data Preprocessing & Cleaning)

## Key Dashboard Highlights
- **Total Customers:** 4.165K segmented customer records
- **Customer Segments Analyzed:** Regular Shoppers, Frequent Spenders, High-Value Loyal Shoppers, Occasional Shoppers, and Inactive Shoppers
- **Monthly Sales Trend:** Tracks monthly sales performance from January to September (Total Sales: 397,059.08)
- **Regional Breakdown:** Compares sales performance across locations including Florida, New Jersey, Indiana, Georgia, Texas, California, and New York

## Included Files
- `RFM_Customer_Segmentation_Dashboard.pbix` — Interactive Power BI dashboard file
- `transaction_data.csv` & `customer_segments.csv` — Cleaned transaction and RFM segmentation datasets
- `Preprocessing-and-Cleaning.ipynb` — Data preparation and RFM calculation notebook
